meta {
  name: publish skill
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  # 发布技能(**201**)

  ⚠️ 元数据走 **query 参数**,body 是**原始 gzip tar 字节** —— 不是 multipart。

  - `displayName` **必填**;`description` 可选。
  - tar 的**根目录**必须有 `SKILL.md`(不是包在一层目录里),否则 400。
  - 超过 10 MiB → **413**。
  - `name` 必须是 DNS 风格小写 slug,否则 400。
  - `visibility` 阶段一强制 `Platform`,其他值 → 400。

  ⚠️ `fixtures/sample-skill.tar.gz` **不在版本库里**,只有源目录
  `fixtures/sample-skill/`(含 `SKILL.md`)在。跑这条之前先打包:

  ```bash
  ./scripts/make-sample-skill.sh
  ```

  改了 `SKILL.md` 之后要重新打一次。没打包就跑,会得到 400
  `{"error":"empty skill tar"}` —— 这条请求的测试会直接把这个命令报出来。

  ⚠️ `file:` 的值**必须写成 `@file(...)`** —— 少了 `@` 只会把路径字符串当正文发出去
  (会得到同样的 `{"error":"empty skill tar"}` 或 `invalid skill tar`)。
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/skills/bruno-demo/publish?displayName=Bruno%20Demo&description=Throwaway%20skill%20for%20exercising%20publish
  body: file
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-CubePilot-User: {{user}}
}

body:file {
  file: @file(./fixtures/sample-skill.tar.gz)
  @contentType: application/gzip
}

tests {
  test("201, or a pointer to the missing fixture", function() {
    // fixtures/sample-skill.tar.gz is generated from fixtures/sample-skill/,
    // not committed. Bruno's script sandbox has no filesystem access -- fs is
    // not in the module whitelist -- so this request can neither build the tar
    // nor detect that it is absent. The test is the only place that can turn
    // the opaque 400 into the command that fixes it.
    if (res.status === 400 && (res.body.error || "").includes("empty skill tar")) {
      throw new Error("fixtures/sample-skill.tar.gz is missing -- run ./scripts/make-sample-skill.sh (see the collection README's setup step)")
    }
    expect(res.status).to.equal(201)
  })
  test("enveloped under skill", function() {
    expect(res.body).to.have.property("skill")
  })
}
